From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DeepSeek Harness <noreply@deepseek.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 09:32:43 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Coalesce folder reloads and background notifications for
 finished transfers, and stop idle speed samples and unfocused auto-refreshes,
 so bursts of small uploads cannot keep the main thread busy

---
 CHANGELOG.md          |  1 +
 app/files.go          | 38 ++++++++++++++++++++-
 app/session.go        |  1 +
 app/transfers.go      | 78 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 app/transfers_test.go | 53 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 5 files changed, 167 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CHANGELOG.md b/CHANGELOG.md
index 0956612..70b2d8c 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -11,6 +11,7 @@
 ### 修复
 
 - 不再在窗口获得焦点或登录时自动读取剪贴板，避免剪贴板所有者无响应时 GTK 的同步读取卡住主线程；分享链接改由文件工具栏的链接按钮或 Cmd-V 显式读取。
+- 上传大量小文件时，合并同一目录的完成刷新（约 500 毫秒内一次）与后台完成通知（2 秒内合成一条），并停止空闲时每秒重绘图表和失焦窗口的定时目录刷新，减少界面无响应。
 
 ## [0.8.3] - 2026-11-09
 
